      <rules>
        <rule name="Bestial" id="a82f-9497-747d-2454" hidden="false">
          <description>Ulfwerenar are ravenous and therefore immune to psychology.


Also despite being greatly revered by their barbarian kinsmen, Ulfwerenar are
too feral and uncontrolled to become the leader of the warband.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule name="Disclaimer" id="a22a-9bf0-b2a4-d613" hidden="false">
          <description>By selecting the Ulfwerenar model instead of the Wulfen the warband rating for this warband becomes 1c.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
