      <rules>
        <rule name="Bestial" id="941c-4635-ecbc-79b5" hidden="false">
          <description>Wulfen are ravenous and therefore immune to psychology.


Also despite being greatly revered by their barbarian kinsmen, Wulfen are
too feral and uncontrolled to become the leader of the warband.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule name="Disclaimer" id="b1cf-85f6-32e1-905a" hidden="false">
          <description>In the original (1b) pubblication the actual race of the Wulfen is not mentioned, logically speaking he should not be human, but I&apos;ve linked both human max stats and werecreature max stats so both are available for reference.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
