      <rules>
        <rule name="Pack Leader" id="a91a-ed44-1eb2-3304" hidden="false">
          <description>Wolves are feral animals that only respond to the strongest in their pack – the
Wulfen (Ulfwerenar).


In the event that no Wulfen (Ulfwerenar) is included in the warband due to a death or an injury, the wolves cannot be used until the creature is replaced.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
